      "proposition": {
        "predicate": "summary",
        "object": "On June 5, at the American Diabetes Association’s Scientific Sessions in New Orleans, several attendees were removed after repeated disruptions. I apologized soon after — to the individuals directly involved and to the broader diabetes community — for the distress that day caused, and I meant it. I also promised a full accounting by independent reviewers of what happened. That review, conducted by five independent volunteer investigators, is now complete . I believe its findings deserve to be heard directly, rather than filtered through three months of competing narratives. Read the rest&hellip;"
